    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im feeling kinda weird lately. i keep getting these sudden bouts of confusion where i just cant think straight or find simple words when im talking. it only lasts like a couple mins but it's pretty scary. do u think this is just brain fog from being stressed and not sleeping enough? i've been working a lot lately.",
